This is an extended version of !Lander that has a
larger landscape.

It should work on all versions of RISC OS.

See lander.bbcelite.com for details.

Build: 2026-11-12 15-51-51

Tile corners: TILES_X = 65
              TILES_Z = 65

To get the number of tiles in each direction,
subtract 1 from the number of tile corners.
